# Testing Emag current draw

Using:
  1 ohm shunt resistor
  Oscilloscope
  Power Supply
  Emag

Magnet works

## Test One
  no load:
    Vin = 4.80V
    Vout = 4.48V
    Voltage drop = Vin - Vout = 0.32V

## Test Two
  no load:
    Vin = 4.88V
    Vout = 4.48V
    Voltage drop = 0.40V

